WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
[Soft instrumental music]
Folded: the map sits above the day’s itinerary.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.667
Illustrated transition to the inner display.

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:07.533
Unfolded: the map and itinerary appear side by side.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:09.533
Show on Map highlights the boardwalk stop.

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:10.200
Illustrated transition to the outer display.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.200
Folded: the same trip returns to a compact layout.
